OL,3,AKey takeaways from BBC interview as
OL,4,AEarl Spencer defends claims about King
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarl Spencer has told the BBC writing
OL,7,Fhis book about sister Princess Diana,
OL,8,Fwhich has made headlines for its
OL,9,Fcriticism of King Charles, was his
OL,10,F"duty...as an eyewitness to history".
OL,12,FIn an interview with the BBC's Laura
OL,13,FKuenssberg ahead of the memoir's
OL,14,Frelease on Tuesday, Earl Spencer said
OL,15,Fhe wanted "to put things down once and
OL,16,Ffor all that were true".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
